  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "可愛いツリーだな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901017280040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "でしょー？\r\nこれ！　ってやつ見つけるの時間かかっちゃった",
    "charAnim1": "wink",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490101728/4901017280040"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901017280050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "気に入ってもらえると嬉しいんですけども",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490101728/4901017280050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "気に入るに決まってるだろ\r\nありがとう、大事にする",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──このぐらいのサイズだったら\r\n来年からも毎年準備できそうだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901017280060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ふふ、いいねそれ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490101728/4901017280060"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901017280070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "来年はＰたんが飾ってさ\r\nツリーの下にプレゼント、置いといてよ",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490101728/4901017280070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……サイズ的に飴とかになりそうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901017280080,
